#: ../../tools/ebi_proteins_epitope_tools.rst:36
#: 0202e3210a774f5fb49664117b9197d0
msgid ""
"``accession`` (string) (required) UniProt accession number for the "
"protein. Examples: 'P04637' (TP53), 'P00533' (EGFR), 'P01308' (insulin), "
"'P0DTC2' (SARS-CoV-2 spike protein)."
msgstr ""

